#: ui/general.ui:107
msgid "Install / Update / Remove"
msgstr "Installer / opdater / afinstaller"

#: ui/general.ui:110
msgid ""
"This device requires root privileges to change the charging limit. Setup a "
"privileged script and give user access via polkit.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Root privileges are required</b> to install, update or remove the polkit "
"policy script.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Install / Update </b> this polkit policy script and continue using this "
"extension.\n"
"<b>Remove</b> this polkit policy script before uninstalling this extension."
msgstr ""
"Denne enhed kræver rodadgang for at ændre tærsklen. Lav et "
"priviligeret script og give brugeren adgang vha. polkit.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Rodadgang er påkrævet</b> for at installere, opdatere eller fjerne polkit "
"policy script.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Installer / opdater </b> dette polkit policy script og fortsæt med at bruge "
"denne udvidelse.\n"
"<b>Fjern</b> dette polkit policy script før afinstallation af denne udvidelse."

